# Dreadhorde Arcanist's target is checked again as the trigger resolves (CR 608.2b), against its power then. Faithless Looting
# on turn 1 discards a Lightning Bolt (mana value 1) and a Mountain. On turn 5 the 1-power Arcanist attacks and its trigger
# targets the Bolt; Bot2 answers with Ray of Enfeeblement, and the Arcanist is -3/2 as the trigger resolves. No mana value
# is at most -3, so the Bolt is no longer a legal target, the trigger does nothing, and its "you may cast" is never asked:
# the Bolt stays in the graveyard. The Arcanist deals no combat damage.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Faithless Looting
Dreadhorde Arcanist
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mountain
Mountain x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Ray of Enfeeblement
Swamp x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Lightning Bolt; Mountain)
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Swamp.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Dreadhorde Arcanist.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Dreadhorde Arcanist)
Bot1.Target(Lightning Bolt)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Ray of Enfeeblement.Cast(Dreadhorde Arcanist)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Dreadhorde Arcanist.Power = -3
Bot1.Pass
! Bot1.Accept
Bot2.Pass
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Faithless Looting; Mountain; Lightning Bolt
Exile.Count = 0
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot2.Graveyard = Ray of Enfeeblement; Swamp
